.IX Title "Encode::ISO2022JP2 3"
.TH Encode::ISO2022JP2 3 "2013-09-23" "perl v5.34.0" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "NAME"
Encode::ISO2022JP2 \- iso\-2022\-jp\-2 \- Extended iso\-2022\-jp character set
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.Vb 4
\&    use Encode::ISO2022JP2;
\&    use Encode qw/encode decode/;
\&    $byte = encode("iso\-2022\-jp\-2", $utf8);
\&    $utf8 = decode("iso\-2022\-jp\-2", $byte);
.Ve
.SH "ABSTRACT"
.IX Header "ABSTRACT"
This module provides iso2022\-jp\-2 encoding.
.PP
.Vb 4
\&  Canonical       Alias                           Description
\&  \-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-
\&  iso\-2022\-jp\-2   qr/\ebiso\-?2022\-?jp\-?2$/i        RFC 1554
\&  \-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-\-
.Ve
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
To find out how to use this module in detail, see Encode.
.SS "Note on Implementation"
.IX Subsection "Note on Implementation"
Though \s-1RFC 1554\s0 allows designation of \s-1JIS X 0201\s0 Latin set at end of the
lines, it also states that such use of non-ASCII is \*(L"discouraged\*(R".
So by this module, \s-1ASCII\s0 is always assumed at end of encoded lines.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\s-1RFC 1554\s0
\&\fI\s-1ISO\-2022\-JP\-2:\s0 Multilingual Extension of \s-1ISO\-2022\-JP\s0\fR.
.PP
Encode, Encode::JP, Encode::JISX0213.
